OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACounty council's Reform leaders
OL,4,Ablock local reporter
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the interview, he said the
OL,7,Fauthority was not given enough time to
OL,8,Frespond to a story written by Local
OL,9,FDemocracy Reporter Eddie Bisknell about
OL,10,Fa woman winning a battle against the
OL,11,Fcouncil over a fence put in her garden
OL,12,Fwall.
OL,14,FBisknell writes for the Derby Telegraph
OL,15,Fand its online arm Derbyshire Live as
OL,16,Fpart of the BBC-funded LDR scheme. His
OL,17,Fstories also appear on the BBC News
OL,18,Fwebsite.
